    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;with <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;If the expression <math><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>89</mn></mrow></munderover><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math> simplifies to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> is (where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mi>b</mi></math>)"
